Armaan — Admin Dashboard & Device Control Platform
=====================================================

This product includes software developed by the Armaan Project
and the following third-party components:

Node.js Runtime Dependencies (package.json)
--------------------------------------------
- express (MIT) — Fast, unopinionated web framework
- ejs (Apache-2.0) — Embedded JavaScript templates
- express-session (MIT) — Session middleware
- better-sqlite3 (MIT) — SQLite3 bindings
- cookie-signature (MIT) — Cookie signing
- ws (MIT) — WebSocket implementation
- uuid (MIT) — UUID generator
- bcryptjs (MIT) — Password hashing
- multer (MIT) — Multipart form handling
- sharp (Apache-2.0) — Image processing
- node-telegram-bot-api (MIT) — Telegram Bot API
- firebase (Apache-2.0) — Firebase client SDK
- firebase-admin (MIT) — Firebase Admin SDK (optional)
- adm-zip (MIT) — ZIP file handling
- cloudflared (MIT) — Cloudflare Tunnel client
- werift (MPL-2.0) — WebRTC implementation

