System Requirements
-------------------
- Linux (Ubuntu 20.04+, Debian 11+, Fedora 35+, Arch, Alpine)
- macOS 12+ (Intel/Apple Silicon)
- Termux (Android 7+)
- Node.js 18+
- Java 17+ (for APK builds)
- Android SDK API 34 (for APK builds)

